	Configure the packet cpapcity notifications for a  DTLS[tx]
apifn	sm_dtlstx_config_notify
params	sm_dtlstx_config_notify_parms configp
	The DTLS[tx] to configure.
field	tSMDTLStxId dtlstx in
	The amount of capacity that must be available before
fnref	sm_dtlstx_status
	reports <code>kSMDTLStxStatusHasCapacity</code>.
field	tSM_UT32 packet_length in
	An indicator of whether the DTLS[tx] event should be set when 
	there is space for another packet to be queued.
field	tSM_INT	no_capacity_event in
unstruct
	Configures when a DTLS[tx] reports capacity for another packet 
	to be queued. It also configures whether the event should be set 
	when there is capacity for another packet.
	<p>
	When
ref	no_capacity_event
	is zero, the event is set when 
fnref	sm_dtlstx_status
	will report <code>kSMDTLStxStatusHasCapacity</code>. If it
	is non-zero, the event will not be set unless a different status 
	will be reported.
explain
	0
retval
error	ERR_SM_DEVERR - device error

